Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): condivisone thread: select del thread e cataloghi
 IT / thread sharing: thread select and IT catalogs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

IT: Due bug della condivisione dei thread introdotti in nk42.
Causa: 1) `ownedBotThread` selezionava `threadId` dal modello `Bot`, che non esiste (il thread è la relazione `thread`): PrismaClientValidationError → 500 su `threadShares/create` e `threadShares/list`. 2) Le 22 traduzioni italiane applicate con uno script di sostituzione grezza erano state scritte come `msgstr """` (una riga PO che compila in un singolo carattere `"`): dialog e pagina pubblica mostravano virgolette al posto del testo.

Cosa cambia:
- `apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts`: `ownedBotThread` seleziona `thread: { select: { id: true } }` (stesso pattern di webhook-inbound).
- `apps/web/src/locales/it/messages.po`: le 22 msgstr corrotte riportate alle traduzioni corrette; cataloghi ricompilati.

EN: Two bugs in thread sharing introduced by nk42.
Cause: 1) `ownedBotThread` selected `threadId` from the `Bot` model, which does not exist (the thread is the `thread` relation): PrismaClientValidationError → 500 on `threadShares/create` and `threadShares/list`. 2) The 22 Italian translations applied with a raw replacement script were written as `msgstr """` (a PO line that compiles to a single `"` character): the dialog and public page showed quotes instead of text.

What changes:
- `apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts`: `ownedBotThread` selects `thread: { select: { id: true } }` (same pattern as webhook-inbound).
- `apps/web/src/locales/it/messages.po`: the 22 corrupted msgstr lines restored to the correct translations; catalogs recompiled.
---
 apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts       |  6 ++--
 apps/web/src/locales/it/messages.po | 44 ++++++++++++++---------------
 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts b/apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts
index 5358156e..04f6e472 100644
--- a/apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts
+++ b/apps/api/src/thread-shares.ts
@@ -40,10 +40,10 @@ async function ownedBotThread(
 ): Promise<{ threadId: string; botName: string } | null> {
   const bot = await prisma.bot.findFirst({
     where: { id: botId, spaceId: actor.spaceId, userId: actor.userId },
-    select: { id: true, name: true, threadId: true },
+    select: { name: true, thread: { select: { id: true } } },
   });
-  if (!bot?.threadId) return null;
-  return { threadId: bot.threadId, botName: bot.name };
+  if (!bot?.thread) return null;
+  return { threadId: bot.thread.id, botName: bot.name };
 }
 
